OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWater supply fully restored at
OL,4,AGatwick Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FGatwick Airport says water has fully
OL,7,Freturned after some passengers were
OL,8,Fleft without supplies because of a
OL,9,Fburst main in a nearby field.
OL,11,FThe issue started on Friday and SES
OL,12,FWater said it found a burst main in
OL,13,FHorley, with parts of the airport left
OL,14,Fwithout water as a result and some
OL,15,Ftoilets having to close.
OL,17,FShortly before 10:45 BST on Saturday,
OL,18,FGatwick said supplies had fully
OL,19,Freturned and all its facilities were
OL,20,Fopen as normal.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
