OL,3,GNEWSAWater supply fully restored at
OL,4,AGatwick Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We recognise the inconvenience caused
OL,7,Fby yesterday's water shortage and thank
OL,8,Fpassengers for their patience and
OL,9,Funderstanding," a spokesperson added.
